=== archimedean ratios of the p-adically related sqrt(Domb) placements ===
  (p-adic:  xi_p(2) = -2 xi_p(3) at p=2 and p=3;  xi_p(4) = xi_p(6);  xi_2(5) = 2 xi_2(7))
  xi(2)/xi(3) = -0.4250216858445427872576134148574227509431   best rational (height<=10^15) -251973489472457/592848548355294   err 9.257 e-31
  xi(4)/xi(6) = -0.4807631305182248626391055414532209940992   best rational (height<=10^15) -108205399904176/225070087607465   err 5.456 e-31
  xi(5)/xi(7) = 0.1713761401717009049129647161028085053677   best rational (height<=10^15) 11400305661807/66522128753659   err 1.883 e-30
  for reference, xi(5) = (15 L(2,chi-3) - 6 zeta(2))/16, xi(7) = (6 zeta(2) + 15 L(2,chi-3))/32,
  so xi(5)/xi(7) = 2(15L-6z)/(6z+15L) is irrational -- consistent.
